{"strongs": "H2268", "word": "חֶ֫בֶר", "translit": "che.ver", "root": "זרע", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine 1.", "gloss": "–abiri", "definition": "II. חֶ֫בֶר , חֵ֫בֶר proper name, masculine 1. חֶבֶר ( ᵐ5 Χαβερ ) the Kenite, husband of Deborah Judg 4:11 ; Judg 4:17 (twice in verse); Judg 4:21 ; Judg 5:24 . 2. a man of Asher חִבֶר Gen 46:17 ( P ) ᵐ5 Ξοβωρ 1Chr 7:31 ; 1Chr 7:32 ᵐ5 Ξαβερ ᵐ5 L Ιεχοβερ ; חֵבֶר Num 26:45 ᵐ5 Ξοβερ ; on possible identification with –abiri of Tel el Amarna v Jastr JBL 1892, xi. 118 ff. 1893, xii. 61 ff 3. חֶבֶר name in Judah 1Chr 4:18 ᵐ5 Αβεισα , ᵐ5 L Αβερ . 4. חָ֑בֶר a Benjamite 1Chr 8:17 ᵐ5 Αβαρ ᵐ5 L Αβερ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2515')\">BDB2515</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2268')\">H2268</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2514')\">BDB2514</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2516')\">BDB2516</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>חֶ֫בֶר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>חֵ֫בֶר</bdbheb> <div class=\"point\"><b>proper name, masculine 1.</b> <bdbheb>חֶבֶר</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Χαβερ</grk>) the Kenite, husband of Deborah <ref ref=\"Judg 4:11\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,11)\">Judg 4:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 4:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,17)\">Judg 4:17</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Judg 4:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,21)\">Judg 4:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 5:24\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,24)\">Judg 5:24</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a man of Asher <bdbheb>חִבֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 46:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,17)\">Gen 46:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <lookup onclick=\"bd